    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991#sch-2-sec-5-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(2) Pre-existing notifications and directions to AUSTEL",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A reference in a notification or direction referred to in\nsubsection (1) to a provision of the Telecommunications Act 1989\nis a reference to the provision of the Telecommunications Act 1991\nthat corresponds, or most closely corresponds, to the\nfirst-mentioned provision.\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16"
