      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Despite the repeal of section 69 of the Telecommunications Act\n1989, that section continues in force in respect of conduct that was\nengaged in before that section was repealed.",
      "skos:definition": "Despite the repeal of section 69 of the Telecommunications Act\n1989, that section continues in force in respect of conduct that was\nengaged in before that section was repealed.",
      "cml:asserts": [
