    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 Pre-existing class licences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991#sch-2-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Until class licences are issued under section 209 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1991, services supplied after the\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16\n\ncommencement of that section in accordance with class licences\nwithin the meaning of the Telecommunications Act 1989 that were\nissued under section 75 of that Act and were in force immediately\nbefore the repeal of that section are taken to be supplied under\nclass licences issued under the first-mentioned section.\n\n(2) This section has effect subject to section 12 of this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Until class licences are issued under section 209 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1991, services supplied after the\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16\n\ncommencement of that section in accordance with class licences\nwithin the meaning of the Telecommunications Act 1989 that were\nissued under section 75 of that Act and were in force immediately\nbefore the repeal of that section are taken to be supplied under\nclass licences issued under the first-mentioned section.\n\n(2) This section has effect subject to section 12 of this Act.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-11-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-11-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f9720c6cd6dec35208b5ca08c315a8ed668c0c541279e6febc991e78f02aaf3a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991#sch-2-sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 Pre-existing class licences",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Until class licences are issued under section 209 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1991, services supplied after the\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16\n\ncommencement of that section in accordance with class licences\nwithin the meaning of the Telecommunications Act 1989 that were\nissued under section 75 of that Act and were in force immediately\nbefore the repeal of that section are taken to be supplied under\nclass licences issued under the first-mentioned section.\n\n(2) This section has effect subject to section 12 of this Act."
    },
