        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) Where before the repeal of Part 6 of the Telecommunications Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-1989",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1989 AUSTEL had commenced, but had not concluded and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991#sch-2-sec-1989"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "reported on, an investigation under that Part, AUSTEL may\ncomplete and report on the investigation in accordance with that\nPart.\n\n(2) Where before the repeal of Part 6 of the Telecommunications Act\n1989 the Minister had requested AUSTEL to conduct an\ninvestigation under that Part but AUSTEL had not concluded and\nreported on the investigation, AUSTEL must commence, or\ncontinue, as the case may be, and conclude and report on, the\ninvestigation in accordance with that Part.\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\n\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16\n\n(3) Part 6 of the Telecommunications Act 1989 continues in force for\nthe purposes of this section.",
      "skos:definition": "reported on, an investigation under that Part, AUSTEL may\ncomplete and report on the investigation in accordance with that\nPart.\n\n(2) Where before the repeal of Part 6 of the Telecommunications Act\n1989 the Minister had requested AUSTEL to conduct an\ninvestigation under that Part but AUSTEL had not concluded and\nreported on the investigation, AUSTEL must commence, or\ncontinue, as the case may be, and conclude and report on, the\ninvestigation in accordance with that Part.\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\n\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16\n\n(3) Part 6 of the Telecommunications Act 1989 continues in force for\nthe purposes of this section.",
