      "cml:premiseText": "(3) Any directions given under subsection 160(5) of the Telecommunications Act 1989 to a person referred to in subsection (2) that were in force immediately before the repeal of that Act continue in force as if:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-20",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20 Existing regulations under Telecommunications Act 1989",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991#sch-2-sec-20"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (3), any regulations made under section 185\nof the Telecommunications Act 1989 and in force immediately\nbefore the repeal of that section continue in force as if made under\nsection 406 of the Telecommunications Act 1991.\n\n(2) A reference in a regulation so continued in force to a provision of\nthe Telecommunications Act 1989 is taken to be a reference to the\ncorresponding provision of the Telecommunications Act 1991.\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16\n\n(3) This section does not apply to a regulation the making of which\nwould not be authorised by the Telecommunications Act 1991.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to subsection (3), any regulations made under section 185\nof the Telecommunications Act 1989 and in force immediately\nbefore the repeal of that section continue in force as if made under\nsection 406 of the Telecommunications Act 1991.\n\n(2) A reference in a regulation so continued in force to a provision of\nthe Telecommunications Act 1989 is taken to be a reference to the\ncorresponding provision of the Telecommunications Act 1991.\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16\n\n(3) This section does not apply to a regulation the making of which\nwould not be authorised by the Telecommunications Act 1991.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-20-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-20-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-20-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bd65ae5ff8e62414585c2209161afb55f3bed36bc7d399bdf952817eec3c112f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991#sch-2-sec-20",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20 Existing regulations under Telecommunications Act 1989",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (3), any regulations made under section 185\nof the Telecommunications Act 1989 and in force immediately\nbefore the repeal of that section continue in force as if made under\nsection 406 of the Telecommunications Act 1991.\n\n(2) A reference in a regulation so continued in force to a provision of\nthe Telecommunications Act 1989 is taken to be a reference to the\ncorresponding provision of the Telecommunications Act 1991.\n\n\n\nTelecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments)\nAct 1991\nCompilation date: 1/7/16\nRegistered: 18/7/16\n\n(3) This section does not apply to a regulation the making of which\nwould not be authorised by the Telecommunications Act 1991."
    },
